[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="BossKit" load_steps=2 format=3 uid="uid://eldoria_boss_geode_tyrant"]

; ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
;  Boss Kit:   Geodelich, the Sundered Heart  (id: geode_tyrant)
;  Region:     Crystal Caves
;  Tier:       3 (mini-boss; act-2 capstone)
;  Level band: 8 (player at chainmail / steel_blade tier)
;
;  Lore anchor (THEME §7 + §8 + data/codex/stag_courts_courtesy.md):
;    A resonant heart of the under-stream — half ancient ward-stone, half
;    crystallized necromancer — that woke when the Sundering cracked the
;    cave's outer wall.  It does not roar.  It chimes; the chime gets
;    louder as it is hurt.  At 35% HP it does not enrage in the
;    grimdark sense — it simply remembers more of itself.
;
;  TTK math vs _dmg_curve.gd:
;    EFFECTIVE_DPS[8] = 17.0 ; armor 0.25 ⇒ effective DPS 12.75
;    HP 1700 / 12.75 = 133.3s  ⇒ inside boss target band (90–180s) ✓
;    Boss damage budget vs PLAYER_MAX_HP[8] = 246:
;      auto-attack avg ≈ 18 (≈ 7% max HP) — not a one-shot
;      heaviest tell ×1.9 = ≈ 38 (≈ 15% max HP) — kid-recoverable
;
;  Telegraph audit (kid-readable rule = 700ms; 1000ms first-encounter):
;    sundering_chime         1100ms ✓ (first-encounter opener)
;    crystal_quake            900ms ✓
;    prismatic_echo          1200ms ✓ (delayed AoE — the floor LIGHTS first)
;    shard_storm (P3 only)    800ms ✓
;    All four meet THEME §1 "kid-first" hand-painted readability.
;
;  Filed flags (raised, not silently dropped):
;    # NEEDS:mesh:geode_tyrant_humanoid_2.5m_crystal_glow_shoulders
;        — character-specialist; preferred CC0 source: Quaternius RPG
;          monster pack (rock-golem silhouette tinted fey-cyan #65DFE5).
;          Falling back to assets/models/npcs/warrior.glb until placed.
;    # NEEDS:arena:crystal_caves_resonance_chamber
;        — environment-specialist; spec embedded below in
;          arena_requirements (radius 14m, ceiling 9m, 6 pillars,
;          shallow under-stream around perimeter, NO hazard floor —
;          we do not stand-in-fire kids at level 8).
;    # NEEDS:audio:crystal_chime_layer_set (low/mid/high resonance)
;        — audio agent; Celtic chamber per THEME §6.
;
;  Loot drops reference items that exist in eldoria-godot/data/items/_catalog.csv:
;    crystal_shard, hp_potion_l, mp_potion, ring_focus, frost_saber,
;    shadow_dagger, crit_amulet, guardian_core. ✓ all exist.
;
;  Maintained by: bestiary-designer agent.
; ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

